    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a96f5ebf03e74ee6b037d8d</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>朋友们，这期我们来聊聊，哦～勒嗝勒嗝～蛋蛋～耶～的陶喆！</span></p><p><span>作为华语乐坛R&amp;B教父的陶吉吉，这几年也是老树发新芽</span></p><p><span>又是一位走过我们青春的老朋友，一起来听听吧～</span></p><p><span>————————————————————————</span><br><br><span>本期节目你能听到以下内容</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="297">00:04:57</a> </span><strong><span>一次听到陶喆，最喜欢陶喆的专辑</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="867">00:14:27</a> </span><strong><span>那些烂漫情歌</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2235">00:37:15</a> </span><strong><span>那些伤痛情歌</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3351">00:55:51</a> </span><strong><span>那些在孤独中陪伴了我们的歌</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4139">01:08:59</a> </span><strong><span>那些陶喆的摇滚</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4645">01:17:25</a> </span><strong><span>那些治愈了我们的歌</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5844">01:37:24</a> </span><strong><span>那些改编的经典</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6140">01:42:20</a> </span><strong><span>那些国风、电子风</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6586">01:49:46</a> </span><strong><span>那些欢快的、搞怪的陶喆</span></strong></p>]]></description>
